    "retrieved": "2026-11-24",
    "placement": "Which family belongs to which order, and the sequence of both, follows the IOC 15.2 master spreadsheet. English order names follow the IOC Orders of Birds page, shortened where that 2019 page still uses a wider circumscription than v15.2.",
    "afrikaans": "Afrikaans order names follow the Afrikaans Wikipedia where an article names the order. Where it does not, the name is the family's Afrikaans heading on this site, or those headings joined. The notes say which."
